  b) A modified version, or a service running one, may use the name
     as part of its own name only if it is clearly marked as a modified
     version and states that it is not the original Program, for
     example "Marcan (unofficial fork by Example Ltd)", together with a
     reference to the original Program.

  c) No one may use the name in a way that suggests they are the
     original author or copyright holder of the Program, or that their
     version, service or license is endorsed by or is the official
     version from the original authors.

A modified version that does not use the name is not subject to this
Section and need not refer to the original Program anywhere except as
required by the other terms of this License.

