Example notice
--------------

An Operator could inform Beneficiaries under Section 2, for example in a
registration e-mail:

    This service runs on Marcan, software whose source code is freely
    available under the Beneficiary Copyleft License 1.0: you may run,
    study, modify and share it yourself. Source code of the version we
    run: <https://example.com/source>
